Detailed Schema Explanation
Customers Table
Stores customer details including personal and contact information.
Products Table
Contains product catalog data with details like stock codes, descriptions, and unit prices.
Transactions Table
Records each transaction made by a customer. Includes invoice date and total amount.
Transaction Details Table
Breaks down each transaction into individual items, linking back to the products and customers. This table will allow us to capture invoice-level details such as the quantity and unit price of each item.
Example SQL Statements for Populating Required Sales Invoice View
To generate the final record of sales invoices with the specified headers (
InvoiceNo
,
StockCode
,
